/T (Critical gap: No Nigerian policy framework currently recognises civic technology as a legitimate instrument of democratic participation. As the 2025 US aid freeze demonstrates, platforms like Siyasa cannot be sustained on foreign grants alone they need domestic regulatory recognition, government data access, and institutional partnerships to survive and scale. A national Civic Technology Policy Framework is urgently needed. )
