<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (Gazette a National Civic Technology Policy Framework Before the 2025 Aid Freeze Becomes Irreversible  The collapse of foreign aid has exposed a structural dependency that domestic policy must address. The Office of the Vice President should gazette a National Civic Technology Policy Framework that: formally recognises civic technology as a public good; establishes criteria for government recognition of civic tech platforms; creates open data-sharing pathways for CSO-built tools; and provides a regulatory environment that protects rather than restricts digital civic space. With 67% of civic organisations affected by the 2025 aid withdrawal, this framework is no longer a future ambition it is an emergency stabilisation measure. Siyasa should be recognised as a pilot platform under this framework. )
/E (Gazette a National Civic Technology Policy Framework Before the 2025 Aid Freeze Becomes Irreversible  The collapse of foreign aid has exposed a structural dependency that domestic policy must address. The Office of the Vice President should gazette a National Civic Technology Policy Framework that: formally recognises civic technology as a public good; establishes criteria for government recognition of civic tech platforms; creates open data-sharing pathways for CSO-built tools; and provides a regulatory environment that protects rather than restricts digital civic space. With 67% of civic organisations affected by the 2025 aid withdrawal, this framework is no longer a future ambition it is an emergency stabilisation measure. Siyasa should be recognised as a pilot platform under this framework. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
