/Title (Civic commitment produces documented behavioural outcomes.  Participants signed public commitment banners pledging to fight fake news in their communities, a documented civic contract. Research across comparable Sub-Saharan African interventions links such public commitments to sustained media consumption behaviour change, particularly among community leaders and practitioners.)
